      177.09,
      219.49,
      387.09,
      230.56
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE COMPANIES ACT, NO. 07 OF 2007",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      245.65,
      402.62,
      269.8
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      284.77,
      402.7,
      308.92
    ],
    "text": "1.(1) This Act may be cited as the Companies(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      323.56,
      402.6,
      374.44
    ],
    "text": "(2)The provisions of this Act, other than theprovisions of this section, shall come into operation onsuch date as the Minister may appoint by Order publishedin the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      388.97,
      402.7,
      426.75
    ],
    "text": "(3) The provisions of this section shall come intooperation on the date on which the Bill becomes an Act ofParliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.59,
      441.28,
      402.73,
      544.6
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 427 of the Companies Act, No. 07 of 2007(in this Act referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended in paragraph (a) of subsection (3) ofthat section, by the substitution for the words and figures\u201cthe provisions of the Registration of DocumentsOrdinance (Cap.117)\u201d, of the words and figures \u201ctheprovisions of the Secured Transactions Act, No. of2023\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.59,
      559.02,
      402.7,
      583.72
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 428 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
