  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.63,
      269.8,
      396.57,
      304.71
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 431 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the addition immediately after subsection (6)of that section, of the following new subsection: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      233.71,
      317.69,
      396.58,
      410.43
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(7) Where any movable propertyowned by a company is subject to afloating charge which is registeredunder the Secured Transactions Act,No. of 2023, the provisions relatingto priority contained in that Act shallapply in determining the priority of suchfloating charge.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.63,
      424.61,
      396.56,
      463.11
    ],
    "text": "5. The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 433 of the principal enactmentand shall have effect as section 433A of that enactment: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.37495756149292,
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      159.67,
      476.68,
      396.47,
      534.63
    ],
    "text": "\u201c Interpretation 433A. In this Part of this Act, theterm \u201cfloating charge\u201d means a \u201csecurityright\u201d for the purpose of the applicationof the provisions of the SecuredTransactions Act, No. of 2023.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.37495756149292,
      9.0,
      10.5
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.63,
      547.6,
      396.49,
      582.51
    ],
    "text": "6. In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.5
    ]
  },
